version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-08-19'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/bushranasir8/negative-transfer-busi-breakhis'
abstract: >-
  Code and result artifacts accompanying a controlled ablation showing that
  domain-adversarial alignment of unlabelled breast histopathology with breast
  ultrasound produces negative transfer: adding the adversarial term to an
  otherwise identical Vision Transformer ensemble lowers ultrasound test accuracy
  from 79.37 to 69.37 per cent and macro-F1 from 0.7732 to 0.5099.
keywords:
  - negative transfer
  - domain-adversarial training
  - breast ultrasound
  - histopathology
  - vision transformer
  - medical image classification
